{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden object game where you must find all the stars to complete the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f 1 Large Vector Artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 600 Hidden Stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 1 Achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 No Hints or Support for extra challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Zoom In/Out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Relaxing music and Ambience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2328\ufe0f Use only your Mouse or Mouse + Keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe Autosave. Pick up from where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f Reset progress and play again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Context:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My friend -the Dream Dragon- lost my collection of 600 stars. Can you help me find them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Left Mouse Button + Mouse Movement: Pan and Movement in the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Left Mouse Button\u00a0 to\u00a0 Collect Stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Wheel for Zooming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD / Keyboard Arrows: Movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press ESC in-game to access the Pause Menu.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Great Collector!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932030/be9cc216962f4cde0130588e09f56d798abe44ce.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932030?t=1758295629","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932030?t=1758295629","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932030/08e7696fb13c08521dd09b3e29ca2a474cb